                        "entry_id": "ec58a6bb-ae47-3cef-97ad-fba789cde657",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of several shrubs, of the genus Tamarix, native to arid regions in Eurasia and Africa, often invasive in other arid regions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
